{"id":"wb-7-515","name":"伊犁清代卡伦遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"伊犁清代卡伦遗址","text":"伊犁清代卡伦遗址是分布在伊犁哈萨克自治州察布查尔锡伯自治县，霍城县的清代戍边遗址。“卡伦”（ᡴᠠᡵᡠᠨ karun）为满、锡伯语的译音，有“瞭望”、“守卫”、“哨所”之意。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BC%8A%E7%8A%81%E6%B8%85%E4%BB%A3%E5%8D%A1%E4%BC%A6%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":88545805,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88545805","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":null}